When Dread End creates pools of darkness you can focus your raging thoughts on them to make them erupt into volcanos.

Up to [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5)] pools in radius 7 will erupt, producing a volcano for 5 turns.

Each turn the volcano will send out fiery boulders that deal [23, 31, 38, 43, 48 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire and [23, 31, 38, 43, 48 (TL1-5; SP 100)] physical damage.

The effects will improve with your Spellpower.
